--
-- * s 40 ends at תשפ״ד־3, which row IL-02 identified, by counting the file's list of amending
--   Laws, as Sefer HaChukim 5784 p. 630; it and תשפ״ג־6 amended ss 40 and 66 from tax year 2024,
--   by two Israel Tax Authority circulars that row IL-02 cites with sha256 (its NOTES.md section 7;
--   not re-fetched here). So the s 40(b) tables in the deposited text govern tax years from 2024.
-- * s 35 ends at תשפ״ב־7: counting the file's list (line 5) the same way, the seventh 5782 entry is
--   Amendment 262, Sefer HaChukim 5782 p. 1000, fetched and read (NOTES.md section 7): it commences on
--   1 January 2022 and applies to one who first became an immigrant on or after that day. Both
--   texts of s 35(a)(1) are encoded (ito-s35-new-immigrant.l4).
-- * Every other section's last entry is older (s 45A תשע״ז־3; s 47 תשע״ו־4; s 37 תשפ״ב; ss 38, 39
--   תשס״ה־6; s 64B תשע״ד־3; s 65 תשס״ה־9; s 1 תשע״ז־13; s 2 תשס״ב־9).
--
-- So for every section of this row the deposited text is the text in force from tax year 2024,
-- unless an amendment exists that the consolidation does not show (assumption A1, NOTES.md). For an
-- earlier tax year the s 40(b) table certainly differed, and the commencement of the older
-- amendments to the other sections has not been checked; every top-level rule REFUSES such a year
-- rather than answer it with the later text. A year after 2026 is answered on the text as it stood
-- on 2026-10-06, a projection (assumption A2).
-- ===========================================================================

§ `The tax years this row answers`

@ref s 40 amendment list (line 1631) ends at תשפ״ד־3, which applies from tax year 2024 (row IL-02, NOTES.md A1)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the first tax year row IL-08 answers` MEANS 2024

@ref the text of ss 35-47, 64B and 65 before tax year 2024 is not verified in this row
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`row IL-08 does not hold the text of these sections for a tax year before 2024` MEANS
    REFUSE "row IL-08 does not hold the text of these sections for a tax year before 2024"

-- Every top-level rule of the row asks this first.
GIVEN a          IS A TYPE
      `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `answer`   IS AN a
GIVETH AN a
`for tax year` `the year` `, row IL-08 answers` `answer` MEANS
    IF   `the year` AT LEAST `the first tax year row IL-08 answers`
    THEN `answer`
    ELSE `row IL-08 does not hold the text of these sections for a tax year before 2024`
